sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as Analytics txn
    participant T as meter_reading<br/>lock queue
    participant A as ALTER TABLE
    participant S as 8 API readers
    R->>T: AccessShare — GRANTED
    Note over R: holds it for 12 s
    A->>T: AccessExclusive — conflicts, QUEUES
    S->>T: AccessShare x8 — compatible with R,<br/>but they queue behind the ALTER
    Note over T: nobody jumps the queue:<br/>9 waiters, 11 s, p50 0.22 ms to 11017 ms
    R-->>T: commit, lock released
    T-->>A: AccessExclusive granted, runs in 0.00 s
    T-->>S: 8 readers resume
